                <pb facs="0425" n="327" xml:id="pg327"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The German Emperor to the
                            President.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rhainsburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-07-06"><hi rendition="#italic">July 6,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">The President of the United States, Mr. <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">McKinley</hi>:</p>
                <p>For Your Excellency’s warm words of condolence in the murder of my representative
                    in Pekin I express my most sincere thanks. I recognize therein the common
                    impulse of interests which binds the civilized nations together.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilhelm, R. I.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
